  "h1": "GST Invoice Format (Excel, Word and PDF)",
  "metaTitle": "GST Invoice Format in Excel: Free Word & PDF Template",
  "metaDescription": "Free GST tax invoice format in Excel, Word and PDF with GSTIN, HSN/SAC, place of supply and automatic CGST, SGST or IGST split. Edit and print in minutes.",
  "short": "Indian GST tax invoice with HSN/SAC, place of supply and automatic CGST, SGST or IGST split in Excel.",
